WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:12.100 line:6%
Go to Gojoline and press Start free.

2
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:14.800 line:6%
Sign in with your phone or email. We send you a 6-digit code.

3
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:17.500 line:6%
You're in. Every new site starts here.

4
00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:28.060 line:6%
Describe what you want. This one: a hotel with rooms and prices.

5
00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.940 line:6%
Choose the site language, then start.

6
00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:49.960 line:6%
Gojoline plans your pages and writes your site. About a minute.

7
00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:53.460 line:6%
Your site is ready to check.

8
00:00:55.300 --> 00:01:15.830 line:6%
Computer view: scroll through your whole site.

9
00:01:15.830 --> 00:01:33.330 line:6%
Phone view: what most of your customers will see.

10
00:01:35.130 --> 00:01:50.090 line:6%
Type a change in the chat, in your own words.

11
00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:53.230 line:6%
Done: a new top photo and headline. The preview updates by itself.

12
00:01:53.230 --> 00:02:12.680 line:6%
Ask for new colours the same way: warm gold and deep brown.

13
00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:35.430 line:6%
Bigger changes, like new sections, ask you first.

14
00:02:35.430 --> 00:02:58.030 line:6%
The new Experiences and Getting here sections are on your site.

15
00:03:03.370 --> 00:03:14.870 line:6%
Open Photos, upload a picture, then press Use in my site.

16
00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:18.800 line:6%
Say where it should go, and send.

17
00:03:18.800 --> 00:03:25.900 line:6%
Your photo is now the big picture at the top.

18
00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:46.100 line:6%
Every change is saved. Press Bring back to go to an earlier one.

19
00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:54.450 line:6%
Changed your mind? Bring the newer version back the same way.

20
00:03:56.250 --> 00:04:00.750 line:6%
Press Publish and choose your site's address.

21
00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:04.850 line:6%
Gojoline checks your site and puts it online.

22
00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:10.950 line:6%
Your site is live. Share the link with your customers.

23
00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:20.950 line:6%
This is your live site, as customers see it.

24
00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:30.550 line:6%
A customer books an appointment...

25
00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:41.450 line:6%
Your dashboard: open, share, or print a QR code poster.

26
00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:46.650 line:6%
Bookings arrive in Messages. Reply, then mark it replied.

27
00:04:46.650 --> 00:05:00.950 line:6%
{tabInfo}: phone, hours, Closed today and a top banner.

28
00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:04.750 line:6%
{settings}: connect Telegram to get every booking on your phone.

29
00:05:06.550 --> 00:05:18.950 line:6%
Plan and payments: your changes left, and the plans.

30
00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:29.050 line:6%
Pay in 3 steps, with Telebirr or a bank transfer.

31
00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:31.650 line:6%
Add the transaction number and a receipt photo, then send.

32
00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:36.650 line:6%
Need help? Send feedback any time.
